  id: astralisk
  dexNumber: 178
  displayName: Astralisk
  lore: A serpent of night sky, winged, crystal-spined and haloed in slow-turning
    stars. The Glowdeep glows because it once slept there, and it has come back to
    check.
  personality: Remote, curious, weighs every word.
